TEXT 80 16 Left 2 ;700V DC LINK: IDEAL GRID-SIDE SOURCE/SINK
TEXT 720 16 Left 2 ;400V BATTERY + 0.1 OHM INTERNAL RESISTANCE
TEXT 80 600 Left 2 ;COMBINED BIDIRECTIONAL DC-DC: synchronous idealized switch + antiparallel diode model
