TEXT 80 792 Left 2 !.tran 0 60m 0 100n
TEXT 80 824 Left 2 !.meas tran IL_AVG AVG I(L1) FROM 40m TO 60m
TEXT 80 856 Left 2 !.meas tran IGRIDBUS_AVG AVG I(V1) FROM 40m TO 60m
TEXT 80 888 Left 2 !.meas tran VBAT_AVG AVG V(BAT) FROM 40m TO 60m
